			short = "The waters east of Durotar carry Kargath Bladefist's name, a namesake of the Shattered Hand clan's former chieftain.",
			full = "The waters east of Durotar carry Kargath Bladefist's name, a namesake of the Shattered Hand clan's former chieftain. The coast of Azshara can be seen to the north across the water, and Skull Rock rises along this stretch of shore.\n\nThe bay has earned a rougher name among those who know it: the Great Sea's midden heap. The tide brings in the sea's rubble again and again, wrack and wreckage washing up near Skull Rock, so the shore never stays clean for long.",
