			full = "Atop the cliffs of Razorwind Canyon, northeast of Razor Hill, a narrow cave opens into the rock. It is small, easily overlooked, but the Burning Blade uses it well: here, cultists drill those newly sworn to the cult, shaping them before they are trusted elsewhere in Durotar.",
