		["echo isles"] = {
			name = "Echo Isles",
			short = "The Echo Isles rise off the coast of Durotar, tropical land thick with raptors and lynxes, home to the Darkspear tribe of jungle trolls.",
			full = "The Echo Isles rise off the coast of Durotar, tropical land thick with raptors and lynxes, home to the Darkspear tribe of jungle trolls. Once, at the height of the Gurubashi Empire, jungle trolls held these waters as part of a realm stretching down to Stranglethorn Vale.\n\nAfter Warchief Thrall saved the Darkspears and brought them into the Horde, the tribe settled the isles anew. Their peace did not last. Zalazane, a witch doctor of their own tribe, had learned the secrets of undeath, and turned zombies and hexed kin against the Darkspears who trusted him. He buried tainted fetishes among his huts on the main isle, twisting the flow of magic through Durotar and corrupting the wildlife and dark places of the land.\n\nAgain and again the Darkspears have tried to end him, and again and again he has deceived them into believing him slain, while his undead trolls creep to the mainland to drag more of the tribe under his sway. The Darkspears remain in exile from the land Thrall once bestowed upon them, watching Zalazane's power fester upon the isles that were meant to be their home.",
