		["razor hill"] = {
			name = "Razor Hill",
			short = "Razor Hill stands where the roads of Durotar meet. South, the way runs toward Sen'jin Village and the Valley of Trials; north lies Orgrimmar; west the road crosses the river toward the Barrens and on to the Crossroads.",
			full = "Razor Hill stands where the roads of Durotar meet. South, the way runs toward Sen'jin Village and the Valley of Trials; north lies Orgrimmar; west the road crosses the river toward the Barrens and on to the Crossroads. The Razor Hill Barracks rises as the town's most prominent structure, and the settlement keeps a burrow besides.\n\nIt was here, shortly after the Third War, that the forces of Kul Tiras proposed a summit with Thrall, offering peace. Thrall suspected otherwise, and rightly so: the summit was an ambush laid for him. Rexxar, hearing this, refused to let Thrall walk into it and went to the meeting in his place. The assassins waiting at Razor Hill found Rexxar instead, and he cut them down.\n\nOrgnil Soulscar keeps watch here still, tracking the movements of the Burning Blade in the lands around the hill.",
