			full = "The canyon splits into two hollows flanking the road between Razor Hill and Orgrimmar, its walls riddled with paths and hidden turns. It is claimed by the Dustwind harpies, who have made it their nesting ground, and their numbers fill the rocks on both sides of the road. They do not tolerate trespassers lightly; the bird women strike hard and fast at anything that wanders too far from the road, and more than one traveler has been dragged down before realizing how many of them were watching. A cave in the eastern reach of the canyon opens further into Drygulch Ravine, a passage few care to take given what nests along the way.",
