			full = "The Scuttle Coast lies where Durotar meets the Great Sea, its rocks still hung with the wreckage of Kul Tiras. Here Admiral Daelin Proudmoore's fleet broke against the orcs, and the ships that did not sink were driven ashore and smashed apart.\n\nGnomish stores still ride in those broken holds, and the orcs comb the timbers for what can be salvaged. But sea elementals ride in on the tide and turn on anything that comes near the shore, and the orcs must fight the water as much as the wreckage to hold the coast.",
