			short = "Sen'jin Village sits on the southern coast of Durotar, a small cluster of huts raised by the Darkspear tribe.",
			full = "Sen'jin Village sits on the southern coast of Durotar, a small cluster of huts raised by the Darkspear tribe. It is a modest place: three very small huts, two small huts, one larger hall, and a dock reaching into the sea where the trolls draw their living from the water.\n\nThe village keeps to old ways. Its people are healers and gatherers of herbs, alchemists who know the plants of the coast and the troll medicine passed down through generations, and it is to them that the tribe's knowledge of roots and remedies is entrusted.",
