		["southfury river"] = {
			name = "Southfury River",
			short = "The Southfury rises high on Mount Hyjal, spilling from a mountain lake in a fall that drops thunderously into the lowlands.",
			full = "The Southfury rises high on Mount Hyjal, spilling from a mountain lake in a fall that drops thunderously into the lowlands. From there it runs wide and swift, cutting the land in two: it marks where Ashenvale gives way to Azshara, and further south where the Barrens ends and Durotar begins. At its mouth the river throws itself over a last cascade into the Great Sea, just northeast of the goblin port of Ratchet.\n\nBridges cross its length, one linking Azshara to Ashenvale, one joining Durotar to the Barrens. Somewhere along the river's course, a single stretch of water touches all four lands at once, the only place where Ashenvale, Azshara, Durotar, and the Barrens meet.",
