			full = "On the northeastern shore of Stonebull Lake smolders the wreck of a Venture Company caravan, still spewing black smoke into the sky over Mulgore. It had been carrying supplies to Supervisor Fizsprocket's mining operation when the tauren, weary of goblins moving through their land, fell upon it.\n\nThe survivors never abandoned the wreckage. They still hold the smoking mound and its scorched cargo, fighting off any who come near.",
